That's not a mouthful.

00:09:18.320 --> 00:09:18.870
You tell me.

00:09:18.870 --> 00:09:21.950
But basically, we take
the Instruct platform,

00:09:21.950 --> 00:09:24.980
and Adé and team have put
it on these arcade machines,

00:09:24.980 --> 00:09:28.100
